+## Recommendations and rationale
+
+- Choose the library and sculpture park on arrival day because they pair an indoor architecture/public-art visit with a flexible outdoor loop while leaving check-in recovery time.
+- Put Pike Place before Elliott Bay on Friday because the outdoor-focused market route pairs with an indoor bookstore while using the corrected 13:00–15:00 window exactly.
+- Protect Saturday morning at the guesthouse because the corrected remote call is fixed; place the garden and Frye afterward because their outdoor/indoor pairing meets the clarified balance without overlapping the call.
+- Pair MOHAI with adjacent Lake Union Park on Sunday because the compact geography supports local history plus an outdoor finish and makes a firm 14:00 sightseeing stop practical.
+- Favor transit with short connecting walks because the travelers have no car and a four-mile daily walking cap; the mileage figures are planning estimates, not live measurements.
+
+## Uncertainty and checks
+
+- **Hours and entry:** The venue notes are a 2026-08-01 snapshot, so hours, closures, admission procedures, event capacity, and ticket availability may change. Recheck each venue's official information shortly before the trip, especially the garden's last admission and any weather-related sculpture-park closure.
+- **Transit and mobility:** Route times, service disruptions, elevator availability, and the walking estimates are uncertain because the source contains no live transit or route measurement. Verify routes and accessibility status on each travel day; shorten loops if the total approaches four miles.
+- **Weather:** October weather is not known. Recheck the forecast and use the named indoor fallback when rain, wind, or path conditions make an outdoor anchor unattractive.
+- **Vegetarian food:** Meal ideas are recommendations, not verified menus or dietary accommodations. Confirm current vegetarian options, ingredients, opening hours, and any dietary needs directly before ordering.
+- **Lodging logistics:** Bag hold is traveler-supplied information rather than a venue-note fact; confirm it with Pine Street Guesthouse before arrival and checkout.
